DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the code in this repository only. The notebooks fetch data
from external services, and that data is neither included nor licensed here.
Each source carries its own terms, and they differ:

  NOAA CoastWatch / ERDDAP (jplMURSST41)  NASA JPL MUR SST
  NOAA NCEI passive acoustic archive       NOAA / U.S. Navy SanctSound
  Argo float profiles                      Argo programme / Ifremer
  NDBC station 46092                       NOAA NDBC
  GLORYS12V1                               Copernicus Marine / Mercator Ocean

None of it is redistributed here -- the repository contains a cache of HTTP
responses so the workshop can run without a network, which is a convenience
copy of public data, not a distribution of it. If you reuse a notebook,
attribute the data to its provider and follow that provider's terms. The
correct DOI to cite for each dataset is in the product documentation, and for
GLORYS12V1 the DOI is given in the Copernicus product page.
